# alt: A tour of Edmund: a heading, a sentence with bold and italic, a table filled in with Tab, a pasted image, then Read mode.
# The App Store preview and the site's tour: one take from a blank page,
# each beat rendering as it is typed — heading, a line with bold and italic,
# a table from Format ▸ Table filled in with Tab, a pasted picture and its
# alt text — then ⌘E to Read mode (the one cut), held, and the encoder fades
# back to the blank page so it loops.
zoom in
